# Prettier's default glob (`.`) touches everything under the repo. Scope it
# to the JS source this project actually wants formatted -- not CI workflow
# YAML, docs, or fixture files, which have their own conventions and get
# rewritten (quoting, key ordering) in ways unrelated to this project's
# actual goal (CMB-40: denser JS, not a repo-wide reformat).
.github/
docs/
test/fixtures/
README.md
CLAUDE.md
# release-please owns these and rewrites them in its own style on every
# release PR; Prettier fighting that just fails CI on every release.
CHANGELOG.md
.release-please-manifest.json
